              %li
                %p
                  and finally pass to a contextual category by the construction in example
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ContextualFromAttributes"}
          %p
            Of course, comprehension categories are easy to come by; perhaps they arise most commonly as
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/display+map+categories"} display map categories
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
